<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday, slaughter steers and heifers steady to $0.50 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-4 1150-1475 lbs 62.00-63.50, individual 63.75. Select and Choice 2-3 1125-1400 lbs 60.50-62.00. Select 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 59.00-60.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 1150-1350 lbs 61.50-63.00. Package Select and choice 2-3 1115 lbs 61.00.</p>
</text>
